tent","details":{"thread":"5f883f84-7854-4a87-a69b-0aa397e3e5a5","prompt":"{\n  \"id\": \"fixture-20261011-1\",\n  \"source\": null,\n  \"goal\": \"交付 src/value.txt 中的独立预期内容；还必须交付 src/details.txt，内容为 ready 加换行。\",\n  \"non_goals\": [\n    \"不修改项目外的文件\"\n  ],\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"allow\": [\n      \"src/\",\n      \"tests/\",\n      \".a2a/quality.json\"\n    ],\n    \"deny\": [\n      \"src/private/\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"completion_conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"argv\": [\n        \"/Library/Developer/CommandLineTools/Library/Frameworks/Python3.framework/Versions/3.9/bin/python3.9\",\n        \"-I\",\n        \"-B\",\n        \"-c\",\n        \"from pathlib import Path; assert Path('src/value.txt').read_text() == 'worker\\\\n'\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"red_commands\": [],\n  \"task_type\": \"后端逻辑\",\n  \"repair_target\": null,\n  \"complexity\": \"L\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"cli\": \"Codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n    \"effort\": \"xhigh\"\n  },\n  \"base_commit\": \"0c0166cae82e2caf2b391b297aa2fd6e5bee7872\",\n  \"writer\": {\n    \"task_id\": \"fixture-20261011-1\",\n    \"attempt_id\": \"0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0\",\n    \"session_id\": \"a1e5742d-3608-4d91-b815-19984eacef53\",\n    \"fence\": 1,\n    \"thread_id\": \"5f883f84-7854-4a87-a69b-0aa397e3e5a5\"\n  }\n}\n\n受管身份：{\"command\":\"submit\",\"task\":\"fixture-20261011-1\",\"attempt\":\"0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0\",\"session\":\"a1e5742d-3608-4d91-b815-19984eacef53\",\"fence\":1,\"spec_rev\":1,\"commit\":\"<FULL_COMMIT_SHA>\"}\nGit 写操作：把执行工具的工作目录设为本 attempt 的 worktree。git add <路径> 和 git commit … 必须各自作为一条独立的工具命令执行；不要与 cd、检查命令或彼此用 &&、分号、管道、换行、变量赋值或重定向拼接。git status、git diff、测试和 git rev-parse 另行执行。两条 Git 前缀 allow 规则只授权对应命令；若独立执行仍被沙箱拒绝，上报问题并结束，不重试或修改权限。\n完成并 Git 提交后，把 FULL_COMMIT_SHA 换成完整提交号，运行以下 CLI 显式交付：\n'/opt/homebrew/Cellar/node/26.5.0/bin/node' '/private/tmp/q76green-ycyd7qmp/source/workbench/src/gates/cli.ts' '--state' '/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-pkv6wju4/state' 'submit' '--task' 'fixture-20261011-1' '--attempt' '0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0' '--session' 'a1e5742d-3608-4d91-b815-19984eacef53' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":19,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:27.102Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt_id":"0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0","session_id":"a1e5742d-3608-4d91-b815-19984eacef53","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"5f883f84-7854-4a87-a69b-0aa397e3e5a5","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"55cb695b-7a38-4567-8fcd-c5db6906e3cf","thread":"5f883f84-7854-4a87-a69b-0aa397e3e5a5","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-55cb695b-7a38-4567-8fcd-c5db6906e3cf"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-pkv6wju4/state/worktrees/0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0","base_commit":"0c0166cae82e2caf2b391b297aa2fd6e5bee7872","card_snapshot_id":"ce957e85-c075-4796-9404-19e5b64b7792","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261011-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":20,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:28.311Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-pkv6wju4/repo","cat-file","-t","119e01c6ba0428e13f3820b88359e9d8b3df41e7"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-pkv6wju4/repo"}},{"seq":21,"time":"2026-10-11T17:19:28.318Z","task":"fixture-20261011-1","attempt":"0eb7b4c2-40e0-42f4-b083-9adce45ac9a0","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-lb3mecua/c-pkv6wju4/repo","cat-file","-t","119e01c6ba0428e13f3820b88359e9d8b3df41e7"],"cwd":"/privat